.TH batten-semver-check 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-semver\-check \- Refuse an API break this branch\*(Aqs commits do not declare
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten semver check\fR [\fB\-\-baseline\fR] [\fB\-\-release\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Refuse an API break this branch\*(Aqs commits do not declare
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-baseline\fR
The rev to measure the API delta against (default: origin/main)
.TP
\fB\-\-release\-type\fR
The bump being claimed, which is what the delta is judged against
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR
The package whose public API is compared (default: batten)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
